333369052192,"y":0.27020408165031184,"h":0.010319173773940649,"w":0.18222221374511716,"text":"artists who raise ethical"},{"w":0.057777776718139634,"text":"issues 3","x":0.088888888696485757,"h":0.010218319406314791,"y":0.28488372128359629},{"text":"their work.","y":0.2863372095466139,"x":0.21333333433333329,"h":0.0087648313872668027,"w":0.080000000000000016},{"text":"Alice:","y":0.29941860500452644,"h":0.010174418079609837,"x":0.024444444655839722,"w":0.046666665077209471},{"w":0.32666664123535155,"text":"Ooh, that sounds interesting. I did a similar","x":0.088888897493435481,"y":0.29941860470624215,"h":0.013234456899214764},{"y":0.3139044103108326,"h":0.010272574911312171,"text":"module 4","x":0.088872448774356586,"w":0.0711439895629883},{"h":0.011836734693877693,"x":0.22666667468707943,"w":0.21777776718139649,"y":0.31387755115593974,"text":"my degree. You should write"},{"w":0.013333332538604734,"y":0.32703488390465651,"text":"5","h":0.0087209296713069984,"x":0.086666667286253177},{"y":0.32848837238588868,"w":0.26444442749023439,"text":"street artists like Banksy who make","h":0.011627906487912565,"x":0.16222222629192001},{"x":0.08666666852981901,"y":0.3415697674924778,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.097777776718139656,"text":"statements6"},{"text":"_society'","x":0.23717659994666324,"y":0.34284490874124329,"h":0.012955737211266416,"w":0.081153192520141582},{"y":0.34156976744849032,"text":"_graffiti.","h":0.013081395674724883,"w":0.075555553436279288,"x":0.36444444424482342},{"text":"Robert: I don't know much 8","y":0.35591836729451143,"x":0.026666666599374018,"w":0.22,"h":0.010360702592499438},{"y":0.35658707415389701,"x":0.30421566188703797,"text":"him. Do you?","w":0.10712423324584963,"h":0.013570038153200681},{"x":0.0088888920604385298,"y":0.39673469400447636,"h":0.013149027143205871,"w":0.42444442749023442,"text":"2 Complete the next part of the extract by choosing"},{"text":"the correct verb forms.","x":0.033333333245917397,"y":0.41133720940139262,"w":0.18444444656372072,"h":0.011627906487912454},{"x":0.026539343378724586,"y":0.44161896035945203,"text":"Alice:","w":0.044699091911315922,"h":0.010657428040796391},{"x":0.088888898780050921,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"[...] He's been doing street art for 25 years, but","y":0.44186046530255541,"w":0.35333332061767575},{"x":0.088888897405219075,"w":0.34222221374511719,"y":0.45632653077518892,"h":0.011836734693877471,"text":"I've no idea how old he was when he started."},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"Actually it's amazing how he's managed","y":0.47093023285100499,"x":0.091111109707786325,"w":0.29555555343627926},{"x":0.086666674637794608,"y":0.48401162767135841,"h":0.013131229634187669,"w":0.35111110687255859,"text":"'staying \/ to stay so enigmatic, but apparently"},{"y":0.49836734675753547,"x":0.088888895147053976,"w":0.33111110687255862,"h":0.013260560327646664,"text":"his friends are really loyal and committed to"},{"text":"helping him Zremain \/ remaining anonymous.","w":0.33999999999999997,"x":0.088888894555555348,"y":0.51306122475524907,"h":0.013101566081144433},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.32444442749023439,"text":"I don't know much about his background -","y":0.52761627927784605,"x":0.088888901421549427},{"w":0.31999998092651372,"x":0.088888893092298887,"y":0.54204081639627255,"h":0.011836734693877471,"text":"nobody does - but I can tell you about his"},{"text":"murals and his painting techniques if you like.","x":0.091111123032660474,"w":0.34444442749023441,"y":0.55668604630507945,"h":0.01310987200055802},{"x":0.026666667036279249,"y":0.5710204081032132,"w":0.24888889312744145,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"Robert: Yes, that would be good"},{"y":0.5857142857104608,"w":0.42222221374511715,"text":"Alice: OK, he started off with traditional painting onto","x":0.026666675127441336,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"y":0.60029069784615996,"x":0.091111115111110974,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.32000000000000001,"text":"walls and then later he started using \/ use"},{"x":0.091111125263047862,"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.35555553436279297,"text":"stencils and spray cans to speed up the painting","y":0.61469387760151017},{"text":"process. When you want your identity 4to remain \/","y":0.62775510236593934,"x":0.091111129020118864,"w":0.35777774810791013,"h":0.013233269672004555},{"y":0.64389534913007473,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"remaining a secret you don't want to hang","w":0.31999998092651372,"x":0.088888893092298887},{"text":"around the streets too long doing something","x":0.091111103494780854,"y":0.65697674409577711,"w":0.33777778625488281,"h":0.013227337428501684},{"text":"illegal! I mean, he is committing an offence.","y":0.67005813939616465,"x":0.091111118748905678,"w":0.33111110687255862,"h":0.013207167022082245},{"text":"Robert: [...] Right. Let me just finish 5write \/ writing that","h":0.011627906487912565,"x":0.026666662466666793,"w":0.42000000000000004,"y":0.68604651193046229},{"y":0.69912790659577717,"text":"down. OK, so what's he trying to achieve \/","x":0.091111126011953758,"w":0.32666664123535155,"h":0.0131169914712711},{"w":0.35777774810791013,"x":0.091111122279378384,"y":0.71510204095581031,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"achieving with all this - what does he believe in?"},{"text":"Alice:","x":0.026597774612831682,"y":0.72951519862796599,"h":0.010446346827915676,"w":0.046804451942443856},{"y":0.72576005826455225,"text":"Well, he's quite political - he calls himself an","h":0.016503602631238068,"x":0.090911700227677097,"w":0.33369247436523441},{"h":0.013185809388452596,"text":"activist and he's against authority in general.","x":0.091111120802273154,"y":0.74273255790391657,"w":0.33333332061767573},{"text":"He has strong beliefs about people and the","h":0.013205979794872036,"x":0.093333349315657482,"y":0.75714285750469978,"w":0.3266666412353515},{"y":0.7730612245440468,"w":0.18000000000000002,"h":0.010369007733403435,"text":"way we live our lives....","x":0.091111113361111079},{"h":0.010174418079609726,"y":0.7863372094921719,"w":0.40666664123535157,"x":0.028888905671213008,"text":"Robert: So what other issues is he most interested in?"},{"text":"Alice:","w":0.046666665077209478,"x":0.026666667928061917,"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.80087209320953212},{"h":0.011836734693877471,"w":0.29777776718139648,"x":0.093333343594486778,"y":0.80081632662700164,"text":"He's anti-war, so some of his murals aim"},{"y":0.81350940594258792,"w":0.32701263427734378,"h":0.015234526030871387,"x":0.090929181463210509,"text":"Traising \/ to raise awareness of the stupidity"},{"text":"of war. [..]","y":0.82848837214364057,"x":0.091111109581292066,"w":0.082222223281860352,"h":0.011627906487912676},{"x":0.50666667413152378,"w":0.17777776718139648,"h":0.013081395674724994,"text":"REMEMBER BETTER","y":0.082848837209875903},{"x":0.50444444618080908,"h":0.013113431346659654,"text":"When you learn a new verb, try to learn the common","w":0.40444442749023435,"y":0.10897959204787333},{"x":0.5066666834489908,"w":0.40666664123535157,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"verb patterns that follow it. As well as the information","y":0.12354651181418319},{"text":"in Unit 1, 1.5 and in the Grammar Reference in the","w":0.38444442749023433,"x":0.50666667898821616,"y":0.13795918353385794,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"w":0.42666664123535158,"y":0.15261627924150889,"h":0.011627906487912565,"x":0.50666668471565746,"text":"Student's Book, you will find numerous tables of English"},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.16715116303511346,"w":0.2422222137451171,"text":"verbs and their patterns online.","x":0.50666667494225615},{"y":0.20348837225379979,"x":0.49333333355335918,"h":0.010174418079609726,"text":"3","w":0.01111111044883728},{"h":0.013246321386220394,"y":0.20348837214810267,"x":0.5199999996748319,"w":0.39111110687255857,"text":"Complete the pairs of sentences with the correct"},{"y":0.21795918354673527,"w":0.24666666030883799,"x":0.51777778506780303,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"forms of the words in capitals."},{"y":0.23539825416305793,"text":"STUPID","w":0.064500889778137283,"h":0.011761631089813873,"x":0.54219400019953479},{"y":0.25000000029286551,"h":0.011632652671969668,"w":0.35111110687255864,"text":"I think it's stupid to fork out 50 euros extra for","x":0.54222221848964691},{"y":0.26308139534941077,"w":0.32888889312744141,"text":"the same pair of shoes in a different colour.","h":0.013245134937519887,"x":0.54444444032516826},{"w":0.35999999999999999,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"In the end, his stupidity cost him a severe injury","y":0.27906976772261349,"x":0.54444443994444458},{"text":"and a lengthy prison sentence.","x":0.54444445370559791,"y":0.29346938769173492,"w":0.23777776718139654,"h":0.011836734693877693},{"h":0.0087209296713071094,"text":"1","x":0.5200000004700257,"y":0.30813953509167202,"w":0.01111111044883728},{"h":0.010174418079609726,"w":0.042222223281860316,"x":0.54222222116462548,"text":"FAIR","y":0.30813953520074744},{"text":"To ensure a","x":0.54444444654002555,"y":0.32267441895795113,"h":0.0087541525704519785,"w":0.086666660308837851},{"text":"., anyone found cheating","w":0.1911111068725585,"h":0.013081395674724883,"y":0.32122093023918796,"x":0.72222222115631329},{"x":0.54444445635782857,"text":"during the exam will automatically be given","h":0.013223778082400051,"w":0.33333332061767573,"y":0.33575581371787},{"text":"a fail grade.","w":0.091111106872558634,"x":0.54444444667483183,"h":0.013168011879434394,"y":0.35020408152478855},{"w":0.18444444656372061,"x":0.5466666637625841,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"Do you reallythink it isb","y":0.36482558169790424},{"h":0.010276459285191164,"text":"to steal","w":0.057777776718139662,"x":0.82666666793722643,"y":0.36482558148829591},{"text":"someone's intellectual property?","x":0.54444444875080023,"w":0.2488888740539551,"h":0.011836734693877582,"y":0.37918367328859393},{"text":"2","x":0.52000000050062867,"h":0.010174418079609726,"w":0.015555554628372215,"y":0.39389534926930359},{"h":0.0110834